From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 08:02:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Validate Gemini schedule before changing the calendar

Ask Gemini first, validate slots (parse, 8:00-19:00 NZ, no overlap with busy windows or each other), insert new events, then delete the old ones. Keep existing events if generation or validation fails. Use an exclusive end date for all-day events and store scheduledStart/scheduledEnd on tasks. Add a patch-delivery directive to PROJECT.md.
